OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Verdi
OL,6,     F1/5. Kate Molleson follows young
OL,7,     FVerdi, whose ambitions soon
OL,8,     Foutgrow his surroundings.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FLive music from bass-baritone
OL,11,     FMarcus Coleridge and pianist Henry
OL,12,     FSmith. Actor, director and
OL,13,     Fplaywright Steven Berkoff on his
OL,14,     Fnew memoir.
OL,15,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,16,     FA beautiful soundscape of
OL,17,     Fclassical music including Delius's
OL,18,     FCuckoo in Spring and Luise Adolpha
OL,19,     FLe Beau's piano concerto.
